":"text","url":"/docs#核心能力","content":"**布局能力**：内置 force、circular、grid、dagre、mindmap、fishbone 等布局。"},"122":{"id":"/docs-21","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#核心能力","content":"**交互行为**：缩放、拖拽、选择、高亮、框选、套索、Tooltip 开箱可用。"},"123":{"id":"/docs-22","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#核心能力","content":"**轻量扩展**：支持主题覆盖、Combo、标签、图标和节点扩展。"},"124":{"id":"/docs-23","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#选型提示","content":"G6-GL 更适合大规模关系图和高频分析交互。如果你需要完整插件生态、复杂动画和更广的图可视化能力，请优先评估 G6 v5。"},"125":{"id":"/docs-24","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#选型提示","content":"<Card title=\"性能指标\" href=\"/docs/metrics/performance\" />"},"126":{"id":"/docs-25","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#选型提示","content":"<Card title=\"包大小\" href=\"/docs/metrics/bundle-size\" />"},"127":{"id":"/docs-26","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#选型提示","content":"<Card title=\"浏览器兼容性\" href=\"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility\" />"},"128":{"id":"/docs-27","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#选型提示","content":"<Card title=\"常见问题\" href=\"/docs/faq\" />"},"129":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","type":"page","content":"自定义 Label Renderer","breadcrumbs":["文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer"},"130":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","content":"自定义节点和边的 Label 内容，同时复用 G6-GL 的定位、旋转、碰撞与调度"},"131":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer#注册与使用","content":"注册与使用"},"132":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer#协议约定","content":"协议约定"},"133":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","content":"G6-GL 支持注册自定义 Label Renderer。业务只负责内容的测量和绘制，节点与边遍历、函数式样式解析、定位、路径采样、自动旋转、DPR/zoom 换算、碰撞检测和刷新调度仍由 G6-GL 负责。"},"134":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer#协议约定","content":"`measure` 返回完整视觉包围盒的 `width` 和 `height`。"},"135":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer#协议约定","content":"尺寸和解析后的样式数值均为 Canvas backing-store px，业务不需要再次换算 DPR 或 zoom。"},"136":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer#协议约定","content":"`draw` 时 Canvas 原点已经位于 Label 中心；边 Label 的旋转也已经应用。"},"137":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer#协议约定","content":"`layout.data` 会从 `measure` 原样传给同一次 `draw`，可缓存分行等业务计算。"},"138":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer#协议约定","content":"自定义内容必须绘制在声明的包围盒内，否则裁剪和碰撞结果会不准确。"},"139":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer#协议约定","content":"未注册的名称、非法宽高或 Renderer 异常会给出警告，并仅对当前 Label 回退到默认单行渲染，不会中断 WebGL 主图层。"},"140":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-label-renderer#协议约定","content":"完整示例见 `playground/demos/custom-label-renderer.ts`。"},"141":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","type":"page","content":"自定义节点","breadcrumbs":["文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node"},"142":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","content":"使用统一 register 和函数式 NodeExtension 扩展节点表现"},"143":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#适用场景","content":"适用场景"},"144":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#内置扩展","content":"内置扩展"},"145":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#注意事项","content":"注意事项"},"146":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","content":"G6-GL 推荐通过统一的 `register()` 注册函数式节点扩展，不要求继承引擎内部基类。"},"147":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#适用场景","content":"需要复用一类业务节点视觉。"},"148":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#适用场景","content":"需要在 WebGL 节点之外增加轻量 overlay。"},"149":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#适用场景","content":"需要对节点样式或动画做统一封装。"},"150":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#内置扩展","content":"`breathing-node` 已由 G6-GL 内置注册，可以直接在配置中使用："},"151":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#内置扩展","content":"具体可参考："},"152":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#内置扩展","content":"`src/extensions/node.ts`"},"153":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#内置扩展","content":"`playground/demos/breathing-node.ts`"},"154":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#注意事项","content":"自定义节点应避免破坏 WebGL 批量渲染优势。"},"155":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#注意事项","content":"大图中不要给所有节点叠加昂贵的自定义绘制。"},"156":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#注意事项","content":"如果只是颜色、尺寸、描边、标签变化，优先使用 `node.style` 和 `stateStyles`。"},"157":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#注意事项","content":"`BaseNode` 与 `registerNode` 仅用于 beta 兼容，新增扩展应使用 `register('node', ...)`。"},"158":{"id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced/custom-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/custom-node#注意事项","content":"更多类型见 API 总览。"},"159":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","type":"page","content":"扩展体系","breadcrumbs":["文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/extensions"},"160":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions","content":"通过配置、函数式映射和公开扩展 API 完成业务定制"},"161":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#先使用配置","content":"先使用配置"},"162":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#注册扩展","content":"注册扩展"},"163":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"扩展实例"},"164":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#自定义-layout","content":"自定义 Layout"},"165":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#decoration-renderer","content":"Decoration Renderer"},"166":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#职责边界","content":"职责边界"},"167":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions","content":"G6-GL 的定制能力分为三层：配置优先，函数式映射解决差异化需求，只有配置无法表达时才注册扩展。"},"168":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#先使用配置","content":"颜色、尺寸、标签、状态和 Tooltip 等常见需求直接通过配置完成："},"169":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#注册扩展","content":"配置无法表达时，从包主入口使用统一的 `register()`："},"170":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#注册扩展","content":"目前支持以下类别："},"171":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#注册扩展","content":"`node`：在 circle/rect 基型上扩展样式和轻量 overlay。"},"172":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#注册扩展","content":"`edge`：选择内置边基型，提供默认样式、函数式样式和状态样式。"},"173":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#注册扩展","content":"`label`：测量并绘制节点或边的自定义 Label 内容。"},"174":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#注册扩展","content":"`decoration`：绘制 badge 等节点装饰内容。"},"175":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#注册扩展","content":"`layout`：输入 GraphData，返回节点坐标。"},"176":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#注册扩展","content":"`behavior`：消费统一事件，通过 Graph 公开 API 修改状态和数据。"},"177":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#注册扩展","content":"`transform`：在渲染前完成通用数据转换。"},"178":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#注册扩展","content":"`plugin`：管理 Toolbar、Minimap 等独立 DOM 与状态生命周期。"},"179":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"有内部状态的 Layout、Behavior、Transform 和 Plugin 应使用工厂注册，确保每个 Graph 获得独立实例："},"180":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"对象和 class constructor 注册在 beta 阶段仍然兼容。对象实例会进行尽力克隆，零参数 class 会重新构造，但只有 `extensionFactory()` 保证有状态实例隔离；新增有状态扩展应使用 factory，新增无状态扩展可直接使用配置对象。"},"181":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"不同类别的实例作用域如下："},"182":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"类别"},"183":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"实例作用域"},"184":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"生命周期"},"185":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"Node / Edge / Label / Decoration"},"186":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"全局无状态描述，解析后缓存"},"187":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"create；重复注册使缓存失效"},"188":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"Behavior"},"189":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"每个 Graph、每次挂载"},"190":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"create → init → getEvents → destroy"},"191":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"Layout"},"192":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"每次执行"},"193":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"create → init → execute → destroy"},"194":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"Transform"},"195":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"每个 Graph、每个配置类型"},"196":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"create → init；后续 update；Graph 销毁时 destroy"},"197":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"Plugin"},"198":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"每个 Graph、每次挂载"},"199":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"create → init → mount → destroy"},"200":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"扩展的 create、init、update、destroy 以及类别能力调用都会隔离业务异常。单个扩展失败会输出带类别、名称和阶段的错误，不会导致主图层白屏。"},"201":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"`ExtensionContext` 将能力分为 `data`、`state`、`viewport` 和 `requestRender()`。新增扩展不应直接依赖 `context.graph`；该字段只在 beta 迁移期保留。"},"202":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"`context.data.getNode()` / `getEdge()` 返回只读快照：元素记录、状态数组和顶层 `data` 对象都会复制，修改返回值不会反向修改 Graph。快照中的更深层业务对象不承诺递归克隆，数据变更仍应通过 `context.data.updateNode()` / `updateEdge()` 完成。"},"203":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#扩展实例","content":"如果注册 Behavior 与内置 Behavior 同名，显式注册的版本优先。注册版本失败时不会自动回退到内置实现，避免配置与实际行为不一致。"},"204":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#自定义-layout","content":"自定义布局应注册返回 `LayoutExtension` 的工厂。通过 `Graph` 执行布局时，每次执行都会创建一个新实例，并依次调用 `init(context, options)`、`execute(data, runtime)` 和 `destroy()`："},"205":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#自定义-layout","content":"布局契约如下："},"206":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#自定义-layout","content":"`init()` 接收完整的 `ExtensionContext` 和布局配置。扩展只应使用 `data`、`state`、`viewport`、`requestRender()` 与 `isDestroyed()`；不要新增对已弃用 `context.graph` 的依赖。"},"207":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#自定义-layout","content":"`execute()` 接收 `GraphData`，以及画布 CSS 视口尺寸 `width`、`height`、可选 `AbortSignal` 和只读 `options`。当前布局必须以 `execute(data, runtime)` 的 `data` 和 `runtime.options` 为准。"},"208":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#自定义-layout","content":"`context.data` 表示 Graph 当前已经提交的数据。首次 `render()` 时它可能为空；`setData()` 或重复渲染期间，它也可能仍是上一版数据，因此不能替代本次 `execute()` 的 `data` 参数。"},"209":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#自定义-layout","content":"启动下一次布局、调用 `graph.cancelLayout()` 或销毁 Graph 时，当前信号会被中止。耗时布局应在循环和异步阶段检查 `signal.aborted`，停止自身的计时器或 Worker，并以 `AbortError` 尽快结束；已取消执行的结果不会应用到当前渲染代次。"},"210":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#自定义-layout","content":"`destroy()` 在本次 `execute()` 成功、失败或取消后都会执行，用于释放该次执行创建的监听器、计时器和 Worker。布局实例不会跨多次执行共享状态。"},"211":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#自定义-layout","content":"直接调用公开 `runLayout(data, config)` 时没有所属 Graph，因此不会调用需要 `ExtensionContext` 的 `init()`，而是直接执行 `execute()`，最后仍调用 `destroy()`。需要完整 `init → execute → destroy` 生命周期时，应通过 `Graph.render()`、`graph.layout()` 或 `graph.setData()` 的 Graph 管理路径执行。"},"212":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#自定义-layout","content":"Transform 同样必须以 `beforeRender(data)` 的参数作为本次转换输入；其 `context.data` 只表示当前已经提交的 Graph 数据。"},"213":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#自定义-layout","content":"布局只负责计算并返回坐标；坐标写入、刷新调度和渲染由 Graph 完成，不需要在 `execute()` 中直接修改 DataModel 或调用内部 Renderer。"},"214":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#decoration-renderer","content":"Decoration 只负责内容测量和绘制，G6-GL 负责定位、碰撞、裁剪和调度："},"215":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#decoration-renderer","content":"`attachment` 控制 Decoration 如何挂载到节点：`boundary`（默认）把装饰中心贴在节点边界，适合 badge；`outside` 将装饰完整放在节点外，适合外部名称；`inside` 将装饰完整收进节点内部。"},"216":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#decoration-renderer","content":"多个 badge 可交给 G6-GL 统一排列、排序和折叠："},"217":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#decoration-renderer","content":"`boundaryOverlap` 可传 CSS 像素数值，也可传 `half-badge`。后者配合 `attachment: 'boundary'` 和 `anchor: 'start'`，按靠节点 Badge 的半高自动重叠，使圆头或 Badge 中心落在节点轮廓上；`top` 纵向栈使用末项，其余方向使用首项。"},"218":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#decoration-renderer","content":"`builtin-badge` 支持以下数据类型："},"219":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#decoration-renderer","content":"圆形 Badge 直径为节点尺寸的 `1/3`，图标占圆形的 `2/3`；文本 Badge 高度相同，最大宽度为节点尺寸的 `1.5` 倍，超长自动省略。业务可通过 `fill/color` 覆盖默认颜色。"},"220":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#decoration-renderer","content":"引擎负责逐项测量、左对齐纵向排列、稳定排序、折叠和 hover 展开；使用内置 Badge 时业务只需提供数据。"},"221":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#decoration-renderer","content":"未注册、非法测量结果和业务异常会被隔离，不会导致主图层白屏。"},"222":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#职责边界","content":"扩展不直接访问 Renderer、DataModel、WebGL context 或 GPU buffer。"},"223":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#职责边界","content":"Behavior、Transform 和 Plugin 只能通过 Graph 公开 API 修改引擎状态。"},"224":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#职责边界","content":"Edge Extension 复用内置 WebGL 边基型，保留批处理、拾取和箭头能力。"},"225":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#职责边界","content":"Label 与 Decoration 只负责内容，定位、旋转、碰撞和刷新由 G6-GL 管理。"},"226":{"id":"/docs/advanced/extensions-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced/extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced/extensions#职责边界","content":"完整可运行代码见 `playground/demos/extension-system.ts`。"},"227":{"id":"/docs/advanced/g6-v5-migration","page_id":"/docs/advanced/g6-v5-migration","type":"page","content":"从 G6 v5 迁移","breadcrumbs":["文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced/g6-v5-migration"},"228":{"id":"/docs/advanced/g6-v5-migration-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced/g6-v5-migration","tags":[],"t