s/guide/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/introduction#核心能力","content":"核心能力"},"3518":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-3","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/introduction#与同类方案的取舍","content":"与同类方案的取舍"},"3519":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-4","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/introduction#适合--不适合","content":"适合 / 不适合"},"3520":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-5","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/introduction#下一步","content":"下一步"},"3521":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-6","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction","content":"**G6-GL** 是一个基于 **WebGL** 的高性能图可视化与分析引擎，为**大规模图数据**而生。它聚焦「把该快的地方做到极致」——万级节点实时渲染、高频交互近乎零成本，核心引擎仅约 28 KB（brotli），与 AntV 生态保持一致的设计风格。"},"3522":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-7","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction#为什么再造一个轻量引擎","content":"图可视化常见两类诉求：**功能全面**与**大规模 + 高性能**。前者有 G6 v5 这样功能完备、插件生态丰富的方案，但当节点规模上万、且需要频繁高亮 / 选中 / 邻居聚焦时，基于 Canvas 的全量重绘会成为瓶颈。"},"3523":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-8","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction#为什么再造一个轻量引擎","content":"G6-GL 针对后一类场景重新设计："},"3524":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-9","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction#为什么再造一个轻量引擎","content":"**WebGL 渲染管线**：节点（circle / rect）与边（line / arc / cubic / polyline）以极少的 draw call 由 GPU 绘制，万级节点稳定渲染。"},"3525":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-10","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction#为什么再造一个轻量引擎","content":"**增量更新近零成本**：高亮、状态变更走 `RefreshLevel` 分级调度 + GPU patch，只更新变化的那一小块缓冲区，单次开销约 0 ms——这正是分析型交互的主战场。"},"3526":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-11","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction#为什么再造一个轻量引擎","content":"**GPU 拾取**：基于 Framebuffer 的颜色拾取，约 0.1 ms 完成命中检测，优于传统空间索引方案。"},"3527":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-12","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction#为什么再造一个轻量引擎","content":"**极致轻量**：核心约 28 KB（brotli），全量含 14 种布局也仅约 99 KB，约为 G6 v5 的 1/4。"},"3528":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-13","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction#核心能力","content":"⚡ **高性能渲染** — Array 化的 DataModel、分级刷新调度、静态样式优先、Float32Array 指数增长缓冲。"},"3529":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-14","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction#核心能力","content":"🧭 **14 种内置布局** — force / d3-force / force-atlas2 / fruchterman / circular / concentric / radial / grid / dagre / mds / random，外加自研的 mindmap / indented / fishbone，≥1000 节点的力导向自动走 Worker。"},"3530":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-15","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction#核心能力","content":"🖱️ **完整交互** — `zoom-canvas` / `drag-canvas` / `drag-node` / `click-select` / `hover-highlight` / `brush-select` / `lasso-select` 等开箱即用、可组合。"},"3531":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-16","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction#核心能力","content":"🧩 **Combo 分组** — 支持节点分组容器、嵌套、折叠展开与整体拖拽。"},"3532":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-17","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction#核心能力","content":"🏷️ **标签与图标** — 节点 / 边文本标签、图标，Canvas 2D 叠加绘制。"},"3533":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-18","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction#核心能力","content":"🎨 **主题** — 内置 light / dark，支持 token 覆盖。"},"3534":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-19","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/introduction#与同类方案的取舍","content":"维度"},"3535":{"id":"/docs/guide/introduction-20","page_id":"/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[