rics/browser-compatibility-45","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#最低浏览器版本","content":"Android WebView / Chrome"},"4326":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-46","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#最低浏览器版本","content":"80+"},"4327":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-47","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#最低浏览器版本","content":"✅"},"4328":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-48","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#最低浏览器版本","content":"低端机显存受限，建议控制渲染规模"},"4329":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-49","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#最低浏览器版本","content":"> 这些版本是语法与平台能力下限，不等于完整真机认证矩阵。G6-GL 产物为 ESM-only；如需兼容更老环境，业务侧需要自行转译并补齐所需 polyfill。"},"4330":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-50","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"特性"},"4331":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-51","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"G6-GL 是否需要"},"4332":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-52","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"说明"},"4333":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-53","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"WebGL 1.0"},"4334":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-54","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"**必需**"},"4335":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-55","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"不支持则抛出 `WebGL not supported`，需业务侧捕获并降级"},"4336":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-56","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"WebGL 2.0"},"4337":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-57","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"不需要"},"4338":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-58","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"即使环境为 WebGL2，G6-GL 仍以 WebGL1 上下文运行"},"4339":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-59","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"`OES_standard_derivatives`"},"4340":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-60","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"可选"},"4341":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-61","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"缺失时渲染仍可进行，部分边缘抗锯齿效果略有差异"},"4342":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-62","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"硬件加速"},"4343":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-63","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"推荐"},"4344":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-64","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#webgl-支持矩阵","content":"软件渲染（如禁用 GPU）下大规模图性能会明显下降"},"4345":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-65","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#已知问题与注意事项","content":"**WebGL 不可用时**：当浏览器禁用硬件加速、显卡进黑名单、或在无 GPU 的环境（部分远程桌面 / 虚拟机）中，`getContext('webgl')` 返回 `null`，G6-GL 会抛出 `WebGL not supported`。建议在初始化处 `try/catch` 并向用户提示。"},"4346":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-66","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#已知问题与注意事项","content":"**Safari 颜色管理**：Safari 对 WebGL 画布存在色彩管理（color profile）差异，同一颜色在 Safari 与 Chrome 间可能有肉眼可辨的细微偏差，属浏览器行为，非 G6-GL bug。"},"4347":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-67","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#已知问题与注意事项","content":"**移动端显存**：iOS / 低端 Android 设备显存与纹理尺寸上限较低，超大规模图（数十万节点）可能触发上下文丢失（context lost）。G6-GL 监听 `WEBGL_lose_context` 相关行为，但业务侧仍应控制单屏渲染规模。"},"4348":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-68","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#已知问题与注意事项","content":"**高 DPR 屏幕**：在 Retina 等高 devicePixelRatio 屏幕上，画布像素数成倍增长，需权衡清晰度与性能。"},"4349":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-69","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#已知问题与注意事项","content":"**多实例 WebGL 上下文**：浏览器对单页面活动 WebGL 上下文数量有限制（通常 8–16 个）。同一页面创建过多 Graph 实例可能导致最早的上下文被回收。"},"4350":{"id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility-70","page_id":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/browser-compatibility#测试范围说明","content":"当前兼容性数据以 **Chrome / Firefox / Safari / Edge 的最新稳定版**为主要测试目标，移动端以 iOS Safari 与 Android Chrome 为参考。更广泛的真机矩阵（含低端机型）将在后续版本通过 BrowserStack 抽样补充。"},"4351":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","type":"page","content":"包大小","breadcrumbs":["文档","指标"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size"},"4352":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-0","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","content":"G6-GL 的真实打包体积与同类图可视化库横向对比"},"4353":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-1","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#测量方法","content":"测量方法"},"4354":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-2","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#g6-gl-体积构成","content":"G6-GL 体积构成"},"4355":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-3","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#横向对比","content":"横向对比"},"4356":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-4","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#如何进一步减小体积","content":"如何进一步减小体积"},"4357":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-5","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","content":"包体积直接影响首屏加载与 npm 安装成本，是衡量一个前端库「轻量」与否的核心指标。本页给出 G6-GL 的真实打包体积，并与同类图可视化库横向对比。"},"4358":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-6","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#测量方法","content":"体积数据由 size-limit 自动产出，已接入 CI——每个 PR 都会自动检查体积是否超过阈值，防止无意间的体积膨胀。测量口径如下："},"4359":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-7","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#测量方法","content":"**入口**：`dist/index.js`（即 `import { Graph } from '@antv/g6-gl'` 的实际入口）。"},"4360":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-8","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#测量方法","content":"**打包器**：size-limit 内部使用 esbuild 将整棵依赖树 bundle 成单文件，模拟用户真实引入后打进业务 bundle 的体积。"},"4361":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-9","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#测量方法","content":"**压缩**：分别给出 minify + **gzip** 与 minify + **brotli** 两种结果（gzip 为最通用口径，brotli 为现代浏览器/CDN 常见口径）。"},"4362":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-10","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#测量方法","content":"**复现**：在仓库根目录执行 `npm run size` 即可。"},"4363":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-11","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#测量方法","content":"> 体积会随版本演进变化，下表数据基于 `0.1.0-beta` 阶段构建产物。CI 中的体积阈值见仓库根 `.size-limit.json`。"},"4364":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-12","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#g6-gl-体积构成","content":"维度"},"4365":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-13","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#g6-gl-体积构成","content":"体积（minify + gzip）"},"4366":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-14","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#g6-gl-体积构成","content":"体积（minify + brotli）"},"4367":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-15","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#g6-gl-体积构成","content":"**核心引擎**（不含布局/图数据依赖）"},"4368":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-16","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#g6-gl-体积构成","content":"\\~32 KB"},"4369":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-17","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#g6-gl-体积构成","content":"**28.05 KB**"},"4370":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-18","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#g6-gl-体积构成","content":"**全量**（含 `@antv/graphlib` + `@antv/layout`）"},"4371":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-19","page_id":"/docs/metrics