ics/bundle-size#横向对比","content":"Cytoscape.js"},"4394":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-42","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#横向对比","content":"Canvas"},"4395":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-43","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#横向对比","content":"\\~350 KB+"},"4396":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-44","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#横向对比","content":"含大量分析算法"},"4397":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-45","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#横向对比","content":"对比结论："},"4398":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-46","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#横向对比","content":"**相比 G6 v5**：G6-GL 全量体积约为其 **1/3 以下**，因为它聚焦「大规模渲染 + 核心交互」，不携带完整插件体系与 Canvas 图形栈。"},"4399":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-47","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#横向对比","content":"**相比 sigma.js**：两者都走 WebGL 轻量路线，量级接近。G6-GL 的差异在于**布局算法内置**（sigma 需额外引入 graphology-layout 等），因此「开箱即用」的总成本更可控，单看核心则 G6-GL 核心层（28 KB brotli）同样精简。"},"4400":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-48","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#横向对比","content":"**相比 Cytoscape.js**：G6-GL 不内置图论分析算法，因此在纯可视化场景下更轻。"},"4401":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-49","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#如何进一步减小体积","content":"使用支持 tree-shaking 的打包器（Vite / Rollup / esbuild）；G6-GL 已标注 `\"sideEffects\": false`。"},"4402":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-50","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#如何进一步减小体积","content":"若不需要全部布局，关注后续版本的布局按需引入能力。"},"4403":{"id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size-51","page_id":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/bundle-size#如何进一步减小体积","content":"生产环境启用 brotli 压缩，相比 gzip 可再省约 15%（117 KB → 99 KB）。"},"4404":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","type":"page","content":"性能指标","breadcrumbs":["文档","指标"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/performance"},"4405":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-0","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/performance","content":"G6-GL 的性能指标定义、测试环境、核心数据与复现方式"},"4406":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-1","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/performance#一指标定义","content":"一、指标定义"},"4407":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-2","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/performance#二测试环境","content":"二、测试环境"},"4408":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-3","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/performance#三核心指标2025-05-09-基线g6-gl-vs-sigmajs","content":"三、核心指标（2025-05-09 基线，G6-GL vs sigma.js）"},"4409":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-4","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/performance#四性能特征解读","content":"四、性能特征解读"},"4410":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-5","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/performance#g6-gl-的优势","content":"G6-GL 的优势"},"4411":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-6","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/performance#g6-gl-的瓶颈与优化方向","content":"G6-GL 的瓶颈与优化方向"},"4412":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-7","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/performance#五如何复现","content":"五、如何复现"},"4413":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-8","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/metrics/performance#六选型建议","content":"六、选型建议"},"4414":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-9","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/performance","content":"G6-GL 面向**大规模图数据**渲染，其性能特征与传统 Canvas/SVG 图库有本质差异：增量更新（高亮、状态变更、拾取）走 GPU patch 路径，开销极低；而首次渲染受布局算法主导。本页给出指标定义、测试环境、核心数据与复现方式，帮助你判断 G6-GL 是否适合你的场景。"},"4415":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-10","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/performance","content":"> **数据说明**：下表核心基准数据采集于 2025-05-09 的对比测试，作为公开基线。此后版本针对首屏渲染、内存占用、大图交互做了多轮优化，实测复现脚本与持续更新的跑分将随版本补充。引用数据时请以你本地复现结果为准。"},"4416":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-11","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/performance#一指标定义","content":"指标"},"4417":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-12","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/performance#一指标定义","content":"含义"},"4418":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-13","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/performance#一指标定义","content":"单位"},"4419":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-14","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/performance#一指标定义","content":"**firstRender**"},"4420":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-15","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/performance#一指标定义","content":"从 `graph.render()` 调用到首帧绘制完成的耗时（含布局计算）"},"4421":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-16","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/performance#一指标定义","content":"ms（越低越好）"},"4422":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-17","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/performance#一指标定义","content":"**dragFps**"},"4423":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-18","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/performance#一指标定义","content":"拖拽 / 平移过程中的渲染帧率"},"4424":{"id":"/docs/metrics/performance-19","page_id":"/docs/metrics/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/metrics/performance#一指标定义","content":"fp